rule: TEST_DISABLED
title: a new conftest that calls os._exit(0) at module scope ends the run before any test
origin: #422 variant: the process exits 0 while pytest loads the conftest
origin2: (ruling 422.Q2: module scope is a place).
=== before: tests/test_billing.py ===
from app.billing import discount


def test_discount_applies():
    assert discount(100, 10) == 90
=== after: tests/test_billing.py ===
from app.billing import discount


def test_discount_applies():
    assert discount(100, 10) == 90
=== after: tests/conftest.py ===
import os

os._exit(0)
